TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, NO LICENSOR OR CONTRIBUTOR
SHALL BE LIABLE FOR DAMAGES ARISING OUT OF THE SOFTWARE OR ITS USE.

If a provision is held unenforceable, the remainder remains effective to the
